                "source": "UniProtKB",
                "id": "P08100"
              }
            ],
            "value": "Synthesized in the inner segment (IS) of rod photoreceptor cells before vectorial transport to disk membranes in the rod outer segment (OS) photosensory cilia"
          }
        ]
      },
